  title: CHEAP KNOCKOFFS
  description: My Pontiff, concerning news. One of our clerics has brought to our
    attention a stall in the Agora peddling cheap paraphernalia related to our sect.
    Needless to say, we have no affiliation with this vendor, and our cleric notes
    that the merchandise is of dreadful quality. Yet, the common folk seem to love
    it. How should we respond?
